  "description": "LHRS-Bot is a large multimodal language model (MLLM) tailored for remote sensing (RS) image understanding, leveraging a novel multi-level vision-language alignment strategy and curriculum learning. It is trained on large-scale RS image-text and instruction datasets constructed from global volunteered geographic information (VGI) and RS imagery.",
